OL,5,G2300 6 Music Artist in Residence
OL,6,     F1/8. South London musician and
OL,7,     Fperformer Shygirl shares the
OL,8,     Ftracks she turns to when she needs
OL,9,     Fto restore some peace and calm to
OL,10,     Fher life.
OL,11,G0000 Sleaford Mods on 6 Music
OL,12,     FIggy Pop asked Sleaford Mods to
OL,13,     Fpresent his show for him - thank
OL,14,     Fyou gentlemen. Expect Miles Davis,
OL,15,     FSquare Pusher, Doctore Rockit and
OL,16,     Fsooooo much more!
OL,17,G0200 Sleaford Mods Live
OL,18,     FCatch the Sleaford Mods performing
OL,19,     Flive at Glastonbury, The 6 Music
OL,20,     FFestival and 6 Music sessions.
